{{!
    @template local_la/pages/report/audience

    Renders report audience rules and forms.

    Classes required for JS:
    * .alert - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .btn - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .btn-primary - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .d-none - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .disabled - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .fa - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .la-audience-autocomplete - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .reportbuilder-audiences-container - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .row - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .show - JavaScript selector hook.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-action="cancel-audience-form" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="delete-audience" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="show-audience-form" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-audience-title - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-audience-type - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-autocomplete-placeholder - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-autocomplete-source="core_user/form_user_selector" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-bs-target - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-bs-toggle="collapse" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-card" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-description" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-empty-state" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-form" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-form-card" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-form-container" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-heading" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="audience-not-saved" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="sidebar-card" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="sidebar-item" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-report-id - JavaScript data or selector hook.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * header - string: Text for header.
    * head - string: Text for head.
    * audience - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for audience.
    * can_manage - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for can manage.
    * groups - array: List of entries for groups.
    * name - string: Text for name.
    * key - string: Text for key.
    * items - array: List of entries for items.
    * disabled - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for disabled.
    * type - string: Text for type.
    * icon - string: Text for icon.
    * has_cards - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for has cards.
    * forms - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for forms.
    * title - string: Text for title.
    * reportid - int: Numeric value for reportid.
    * action - string: URL for action.
    * sesskey - string: Text for sesskey.
    * is_simple - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for is simple.
    * description - string: Text for description.
    * is_role - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for is role.
    * selectid - int: Numeric value for selectid.
    * selected_roles - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for selected roles.
    * id - int: Numeric value for id.
    * selected - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for selected.
    * is_user - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for is user.
    * selected_users - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for selected users.
    * value - string: Text for value.
    * cards - array: List of entries for cards.
    * showormessage - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for showormessage.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "head": "<title>Audience</title>",
        "header": "<header></header>",
        "reportid": 1,
        "can_manage": true,
        "has_cards": true,
        "cards": [
            {
                "title": "Manually added users",
                "items": [
                    {
                        "name": "Richard Burke"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="la-page-wrapper">
    {{{header}}}
    <main class="la-main p-1 pt-4 pb-4">
        <section class="container-fluid">
            {{{head}}}
            {{#audience}}
                <div class="audiences-wrapper d-flex flex-column flex-lg-row mt-1">
                    {{#can_manage}}
                    <div class="reportbuilder-sidebar-menu d-flex flex-column me-lg-3 mb-3 mb-lg-0">
                        <div class="reportbuilder-sidebar-menu-cards">
                        {{#groups}}
                            <div data-region="sidebar-card">
                            <div class="card reportbuilder-toggle-card mb-2">
                                <div class="card-header p-0">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-0 p-1">
                                        <div class="ms-3">
                                            <span class="me-1">{{name}}</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <button class="btn toggle-card-button ms-auto" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#la-audience-group-{{key}}" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="la-audience-group-{{key}}" title="{{#str}}showhideaudience, local_la, {{name}}{{/str}}">
                                            <span class="collapsed-icon-container"><i class="toggle-card-icon fa fa-lg fa-angle-down"></i></span>
                                            <span class="expanded-icon-container"><i class="toggle-card-icon fa fa-lg fa-angle-up"></i></span>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div id="la-audience-group-{{key}}" class="collapse show">
                                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                                        <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
                                            {{#items}}
                                                <a href="#"
                                                   title="{{#str}}addaudience, local_la, {{name}}{{/str}}"
                                                   role="button"
                                                   class="list-group-item list-group-item-action pe-2 bg-transparent audience-menu-item{{#disabled}} disabled text-muted{{/disabled}}"
                                                   data-region="sidebar-item"
                                                   data-action="show-audience-form"
                                                   data-audience-type="{{type}}"
                                                   {{#disabled}}aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"{{/disabled}}>
                                                    <span class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                                                        {{{name}}}
                                                        <i class="icon fa {{icon}} fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </span>
                                                </a>
                                            {{/items}}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            </div>
                        {{/groups}}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{/can_manage}}

                    <div class="reportbuilder-audiences-container d-flex flex-column flex-fill">
                        {{^has_cards}}
                            <div class="alert alert-info" data-region="audience-empty-state">{{#str}}noaudiences, local_la{{/str}}</div>
                        {{/has_cards}}
                        {{#forms}}
                            <div data-region="audience-form-card" data-audience-type="{{type}}" data-audience-title="{{title}}" data-report-id="{{reportid}}" class="instance-card d-none">
                                <div class="mb-3 card">
                                    <div class="card-header p-0">
                                        <div class="mb-0 d-flex">
                                            <h3 class="h6 text-start m-0 align-self-center ps-3" data-region="audience-heading">
                                                {{title}}
                                            </h3>
                                            <span class="ms-auto">
                                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link px-0" aria-label="{{#str}}settings, core{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}settings, core{{/str}}" disabled>
                                                    <i class="icon fa fa-gear fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                </button>
                                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link px-0 me-2" data-action="delete-audience" data-audience-type="{{type}}" data-report-id="{{reportid}}" aria-label="{{#str}}delete, core{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}delete, core{{/str}}">
                                                    <i class="icon fa fa-trash-can fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                </button>
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body p-3" data-region="audience-form">
                                        <div data-region="audience-description" class="d-none"></div>
                                        <div data-region="audience-form-container">
                                            <div class="alert alert-warning p-2" data-region="audience-not-saved">{{#str}}audiencenotsaved, local_la{{/str}}</div>
                                            <form method="post" action="{{action}}">
                                                <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                                                <input type="hidden" name="audience_type" value="{{type}}">

                                                {{#is_simple}}
                                                    <div class="row mb-3">
                                                        <div class="col-md-3 col-form-label d-flex pb-0 pe-md-0">
                                                            <span class="d-inline-block">{{description}}</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="col-md-9 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start">
                                                            <div class="form-control-static"></div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                {{/is_simple}}

                                                {{#is_role}}
                                                    <div class="row mb-3 align-items-start">
                                                        <div class="col-md-3 col-form-label d-flex pb-0 pe-md-0">
                                                            <label class="d-inline-block" for="{{selectid}}">{{description}}</label>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="col-md-9 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start">
                                                            <select id="{{selectid}}" name="audience_instanceid[]" class="form-select la-audience-autocomplete" multiple data-autocomplete-placeholder="{{#str}}search, core{{/str}}">
                                                                {{#selected_roles}}
                                                                    <option value="{{id}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{name}}</option>
                                                                {{/selected_roles}}
                                                            </select>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                {{/is_role}}

                                                {{#is_user}}
                                                    <div class="row mb-3 align-items-start">
                                                        <div class="col-md-3 col-form-label d-flex pb-0 pe-md-0">
                                                            <label class="d-inline-block" for="{{selectid}}">{{description}}</label>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="col-md-9 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start">
                                                            <select id="{{selectid}}" name="audience_instanceid[]" class="form-select la-audience-autocomplete" multiple data-autocomplete-placeholder="{{#str}}searchusers, local_la{{/str}}" data-autocomplete-source="core_user/form_user_selector">
                                                                {{#selected_users}}
                                                                    <option value="{{value}}" selected>{{name}}</option>
                                                                {{/selected_users}}
                                                            </select>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                {{/is_user}}

                                                <div class="row mb-0">
                                                    <div class="col-md-3"></div>
                                                    <div class="col-md-9 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
                                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{{#str}}save, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="cancel-audience-form">{{#str}}cancel, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </form>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        {{/forms}}
                        {{#cards}}
                            <div data-region="audience-card" class="instance-card" data-audience-type="{{type}}" data-audience-title="{{name}}" data-report-id="{{reportid}}">
                                {{#showormessage}}
                                    <span class="audience-separator d-flex mb-3 justify-content-center align-items-center small text-muted fw-bold">{{#str}}or, local_la{{/str}}</span>
                                {{/showormessage}}
                            <div class="mb-3 card">
                                <div class="card-header p-0">
                                    <div class="mb-0 d-flex">
                                        <h3 class="h6 text-start m-0 align-self-center ps-3" data-region="audience-heading">
                                            <a href="#" class="quickeditlink aalink text-dark text-decoration-none" data-action="show-audience-form" data-audience-type="{{type}}" aria-label="{{#str}}edit, core{{/str}}">
                                                {{name}}
                                            </a>
                                        </h3>
                                    {{#can_manage}}
                                    <span class="ms-auto">
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link px-0" data-action="show-audience-form" data-audience-type="{{type}}" aria-label="{{#str}}edit, core{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}edit, core{{/str}}">
                                            <i class="icon fa fa-gear fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        </button>
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link px-0 me-2" data-action="delete-audience" data-audience-type="{{type}}" data-report-id="{{reportid}}" aria-label="{{#str}}delete, core{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}delete, core{{/str}}">
                                                <i class="icon fa fa-trash-can fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </span>
                                    {{/can_manage}}
                                </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body p-3" data-region="audience-form">
                                    <div data-region="audience-description">
                                        {{value}}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            </div>

                        {{/cards}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/audience}}
        </section>
    </main>
</div>
